  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02263",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "雾霭渐浓，从山谷落下来，还搀着一些白色的东西。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The mist gradually thickened and came drifting down from the valley, with something white mixed into it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02263",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "这就成了雨夹雪。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It had turned into sleet.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02263",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "“快回去吧！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "“Let us hurry back!”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02263",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "苗子对千重子这样说，因为她看到了这种白色的东西。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Naeko said this to Chieko because she had seen that white stuff.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02263",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "这不能算是雪，只能说是雨夹雪。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It could not really be called snow; it was only sleet.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02263",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "但是，这种白色的东西时而消失，时而又多起来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But that white stuff would disappear for a while, then grow heavier again.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
